      "writtenOn": "2017-01-07T01:59:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s dependency injection best practice to inject direct dependencies when constructing objects. Passing around Context as a means to get another object violates this.  Ideally, FrameworkFacade#get*Setting should take in a ContentResolver, not a Context object, so we can remove the Context dependency here entirely. \n\ngo/di-practices/inject-direct-dependencies",
      "parentUuid": "97c76e81_b54c648d",
      "revId": "0b0c12aed31325d036caffcb8375df1885ef6ce3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
